<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7204"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 9:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->KAKE is releasing all of the Chapters from BTK&#39;s prior letter as well as the entire postcard about communications #7 and #8. This should include the contents in the Post Toasties Box &#40;or boxes&#41;. It will air on Wednesday, Feb. 16 at 10:00 pm<!--/Text--></td></tr>
