<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7309"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 7:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I forgot to provide the link to the story I was referring to in my last post. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_packages/btk/10842117.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_pack ages/btk/10842117.htm</a> <BR> <BR>iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
