<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7310"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My guess----It&#39;s widely accepted that Arthur Leigh Allen was Zodiac and he suddenly died of a heart attack in 1992 while after years of research &#40;I know I know about naming Jack the Ripper suspects as definative&#41; I believe the derelict &#39;David Cohen&#39; was JTR died in an asylum a year after being &#39;incarcerated&#39; and BTK doesn&#39;t want to &#39;fade away&#39; or suddenly just die without another go round of teasing the Wichita community. <BR> <BR> I figure he recently had a medical scare and his desire to be so original &#40;even though he&#39;s merely a poor conglomeration of those before him&#41; and not die without people hearing his narcissistic viewpoints has him back talking to the media/police.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
