<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7319"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 8:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Am I missing something? <BR> <BR>What do the last two posts have to do with KAKE releasing new BTK info? <BR> <BR>Bestbud, why did you post a link to that site under this thread? Why not, at least, give some sort of message with the link. <BR> <BR>iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
