</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 9:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->KANSASGIRL: Thanks for the excellent update. 2 Questions: <BR> <BR>1&#41; Any ideas on what &#34;C.4&#34; and &#34;C.9&#34; mean?? <BR> <BR>2&#41; Are the above phrases &#34;&#40;...as well as other things/contents not released&#41;&#34; your words or BLTs&#39;? <BR> <BR>Thanks, Victor<!--/Text--></td></tr>
