<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7639"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hbtcontrol<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hbtcontrol<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 9:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Victor, <BR> <BR>I&#39;m wondering if C.4 and C.9 are referring to the chapters, with C.4 containing items BTK relates to Fantasy World and C.9 related to what he calls &#34;Hits&#34;.   <BR> <BR>Also, someone &#40;was it you Kansasgirl?&#41; posted on another thread that information was released about one of the jewelry items belonging to Dee Davis.  I couldn&#39;t find that anywhere. Has anyone else seen that? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
