<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7673"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 6:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you Kgirl.  So, if I am understanding correctly, KAKE did not really announce anything &#34;earth shattering&#34;.  Would you agree or am I missing something of substance?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
