</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 7:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think I got something with everyones help of course, I started a new thread in BTK communications Btks novel in his own clues, Johno figured out that the Factor X was In the #1 issue on x&#43;men comics, the communications #s go with the chapters of his book, when you guys were talking about the c9 etc it hit me, go check it out I think we got it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
