<!--Post: 7721--><!--Time: 1108665627-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7721"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wilmac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wilmac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 10:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just a note about the return address of 316 N. West Street: <BR> <BR>316 is Wichita&#39;s area code. Could his phone number be somehow hidden in the return address? Whaddya think?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7721-->
