<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7753"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wilmac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wilmac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I thought maybe looking at the telephone and starting with abbreviations...If you were to spell it out on the telephone, his number would equal 316-693-7878 <BR>&#40;6=N 9=W 3=E 7=S 8=T 7=S 8=T, or N. West St&#41; <BR> <BR>It doesn&#39;t appear in a reverse directory, so it&#39;s unlisted, or no longer in service. <BR> <BR>I&#39;m not calling the number to find out though. <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0><!--/Text--></td></tr>
