<!--Post: 7754--><!--Time: 1108673156-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7754"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jackal<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jackal<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Amandab - perhaps some of his past communications have already included those numbers.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7754-->
<!--Post: 7759--><!--Time: 1108674128-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7759"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Amandab<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Amandab<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 1:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Jackal- <BR> <BR>Very possible, I would imagine. I just thought that since some folks have theorized that he is making 1 drop per chapter of the &#34;book&#34; he wrote, that perhaps there are only 2 or 3 left.... <BR> <BR>Then he could sit back, thinking he gave the cops and everyone every bit of info needed to find him, and he could revel in his superior intellect when his phone never rang. <BR> <BR>Urgh....I&#39;ve been looking at this stuff too long - LOL<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7759-->
<!--Post: 7761--><!--Time: 1108674766-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7761"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Amandab<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Amandab<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 1:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OMG you guys. Coincidence? <BR> <BR>Ok, so I took NWESTST and looked at it with the grid/letter chart I&#39;d seen before, where A - I=1-9, and J-R=1-9 and so on &#40;please someone find a link to this, as I can&#39;t, nor can I explain it well enough&#41;, and when I plugged in NWESTST after 316, I got &#40;316&#41; 555-1212 <BR> <BR>The directory assistance/information number. An obvious ploy to people wanting more information? Coincidence?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7761-->
<!--Post: 7770--><!--Time: 1108677137-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7770"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brown_tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brown_tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 1:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;316&#34; is the address to Fox 24 tv station on West St.     316 N. West St., Wichita KS. BLT used the TV station&#39;s address as a return addy.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7770-->
<!--Post: 7775--><!--Time: 1108678030-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7775"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wilmac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wilmac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 2:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dang Brown, you&#39;re right... <BR> <BR>I guess before I got all crazy with my idea, I should have actually checked the station address. <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7775-->
<!--Post: 7805--><!--Time: 1108687498-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7805"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tadpole<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tadpole<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Does the number &#34;25&#34; fit into any scenario here?  <BR>Since everyone is throwing out ideas here how about this:  5a4b434 = 5 after 4 &#40;9&#41; before 34 = 25. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7805-->
<!--Post: 7807--><!--Time: 1108687677-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7807"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tadpole<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tadpole<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Or...5 after 4 before 34 = 35. <BR>4 before 34 = 30 &#43;5 = 35. <BR> <BR>I saw that one after the previous post.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7807-->
</table></td></tr></table>
